The TFT LCD driver under firmware/*/src (lcd.c, lcd.h, GUI.c, GUI.h, FONT.H and
derivatives) originates from QDtech / lcdwiki reference code whose original
notice restricted use to study purposes.  The original notice is retained in
those files and in docs/90_THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.  The MIT grant above applies
to the original work in this repository, not to that third-party driver.

